{%- when 'blurb' -%}
  {%- case product.handle -%}
    {%- when "nano-ring-hair-extensions" -%}Each strand has a small tip that is fixed to your own hair with a nano ring, so there's no glue, heat or tape. The rings are small enough to hide in fine hair. The hair is 100% virgin Remy, can be straightened, curled or toned, and lasts up to 12 months with care.
    {%- when "tape-in-hair-extensions" -%}Thin, double-sided tape wefts that sit flat against the scalp. Each pack has 20 pieces of Remy human hair that you can straighten and curl. They're quick to fit and remove, and can be re-taped and reused for up to 6 months.
    {%- when "u-tip-hair-extensions" -%}Pre-bonded keratin U-tip strands, each 0.6g, fused to your own hair one at a time with a heat connector. The Remy hair can be washed, curled and heat styled as normal. Expect 3–4 months between refits.
    {%- when "nano-ring-beads" -%}Copper nano rings for fitting nano ring tip extensions and for refitting them as your hair grows. Each pot holds 1000 rings, enough for several full heads. Choose the colour closest to your roots so the rings blend in.
    {%- when "salon-comb-set" -%}Ten combs for sectioning, parting and styling. Tail and needle-tail combs give neat partings when fitting, pick combs lift at the root, and wide-tooth combs detangle extensions without pulling on the bonds.
    {%- when "steel-sectioning-clips" -%}Stainless steel duckbill clips for holding hair out of the way while you fit, colour or style. Useful for keeping neat rows when fitting extensions.
    {%- when "butterfly-sectioning-clips" -%}Large butterfly clips with toothed jaws and a strong spring, for holding thick sections out of the way while you fit, blow-dry or style.
    {%- when "aluminium-cutting-comb" -%}A light aluminium comb with fine teeth at one end and wider teeth at the other. Use it for clean partings and neat sections when fitting extensions, then for everyday styling. It wipes clean easily.
    {%- when "curved-vent-detangling-brush" -%}A curved paddle brush with vents and ball-tipped bristles. The vents let air through when you blow-dry, and the curve fits the shape of your head. Gentle enough to use around tape, rings and bonds, on wet or dry hair.
    {%- when "continuous-mist-spray-bottle" -%}Hold the trigger and it keeps spraying a fine mist, so you can dampen hair evenly without soaking it. Use it to dampen extensions before styling, refresh curls or mist in leave-in conditioner.
    {%- else -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
